---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="About Cojiro Quiz, an unofficial answer key for the Zelda Notes Ocarina of Time quiz."
>
  <div class="wrap narrow prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Answers to the Ocarina of Time quiz in Zelda Notes, added by players. Questions are stored exactly as the app
      shows them, in any language.
    </p>

    <h2>Add a question</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Screenshot the question. The result screen is best: it shows the correct answer.</li>
      <li><a href="/upload">Upload</a> it.</li>
      <li>Check the text and confirm the answer.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>No screenshot? Type it in on the upload page. No account needed.</p>

    <h2>Wrong answers</h2>
    <p>Use “Report a problem” on the question's page. When uploads disagree, the answer is marked disputed.</p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      No accounts, no tracking. A salted hash of your IP address is kept with uploads and reports to limit abuse.
      Uploaded screenshots are public.
    </p>

    <h2>Unofficial</h2>
    <p>
      A fan project, not affiliated with Nintendo. The Legend of Zelda and Ocarina of Time are trademarks of Nintendo.
      Contact or takedown requests: use Feedback below.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
